cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this list in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Awesome Sleep Tracking: a curated index of tools, devices, datasets and open-source software for sleep measurement"
abstract: >-
  A curated index of the software, hardware, file formats, public datasets and
  metric definitions used to record and analyse human sleep outside the clinical
  laboratory. Consumer sleep devices report same-named metrics computed by
  different, usually undocumented, rules; this list collects the tools and
  reference material needed to work with the underlying signals directly, and
  documents where common metrics such as ODI, AHI and RDI diverge between
  implementations.
type: dataset
